admin-webhooks-secret-outbound = Each delivery carries X-Mailwoman-Signature: sha256= followed by the HMAC-SHA256 of the request body under this secret.
admin-webhooks-secret-inbound = Send X-Mailwoman-Webhook: { $id }, X-Mailwoman-Timestamp (Unix seconds), X-Mailwoman-Nonce (16 to 128 letters, digits, - or _, never reused) and X-Mailwoman-Signature: sha256= followed by the HMAC-SHA256 of timestamp.nonce.body under this secret. Calls more than five minutes off, or reusing a nonce, are refused.
